      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note in this [doc](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/d3d12/ne-d3d12-d3d12_render_pass_ending_access_type#:~:text\u003dYou%20should%20ensure%20that%20the%20resolve%20destination%20is%20in%20the%20D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_RESOLVE_DEST%20resource%20state%20when%20the%20render%20pass%20ends.), for `D3D12_RENDER_PASS_ENDING_ACCESS_TYPE_RESOLVE` it only mentions that the resolve texture need to be in `D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_RESOLVE_DEST` when the render pass ends. It doesn\u0027t mention anything about the color texture needs to be in `D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_RESOLVE_SOURCE`",
